@startuml
title FSM Bake 后 Blob（最终 Graph 与武器 Slot）
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide methods

package "Bake 输入" {
  class "角色 Graph 文档" as HeroGraphSource
  class "武器 Graph Override" as WeaponOverrideSource <<Editor only>>
  class "武器 Slot 文档" as WeaponSlotSource
  class "武器最终 Graph 文档" as WeaponGraphSource
  HeroGraphSource --> WeaponOverrideSource : 编辑期输入
  WeaponOverrideSource --> WeaponGraphSource : 产出完整 Graph
}

class "Bake 编译器" as Bake <<compiler>> {
  +Graph 文档生成 FSMGraphBlob
  +Slot 文档生成 FSMSlotBlob
  +校验父子拓扑、Binding、条件深度与固定容量
  +Slot 禁止 Layer 与嵌套 StateSlot
  +候选段按 (Priority desc, Order asc, Id asc) 排序
}

package "Bake 输出" {
  class ConfigBlobDatabaseSingleton <<existing>>

  class FSMStateMachineBlob <<struct>> {
    +EntityType : FSMGraphEntityType
    +States : BlobArray<FSMStateBlob>
    +StateBindings : BlobArray<FSMStateBindingBlob>
    +Transitions : BlobArray<FSMTransitionBlob>
    +Groups : BlobArray<FSMConditionGroupBlob>
    +Conditions : BlobArray<FSMCondition>
    +ConditionPayloads : BlobArray<PolyConditionInput>
    +StateIds : BlobArray<Hash128>
    +MaxDepth : ushort
  }

  class FSMGraphBlob <<struct>> {
    +StateMachine : FSMStateMachineBlob
    +Layers : BlobArray<FSMLayerBlob>
    +StateSlots : BlobArray<FSMStateSlotBlob>
    +ContentHash : Hash128
  }

  class FSMSlotBlob <<struct>> {
    +StateMachine : FSMStateMachineBlob
    +Mappings : BlobArray<FSMSlotMappingBlob>
    +ContentHash : Hash128
  }

  class FSMLayerBlob <<struct>> {
    +RootStateIndex : ushort
    +CursorIndex : ushort
  }

  class FSMStateBlob <<struct>> {
    +ParentStateIndex : ushort
    +DefaultChildStateIndex : ushort
    +ExitTransitionStartIndex / Count : ushort
    +GlobalTransitionStartIndex / Count : ushort
    +EntryTransitionStartIndex / Count : ushort
    +StateSlotIndex : ushort
  }

  class FSMStateBindingBlob <<struct>> {
    +Skill : FixedString64Bytes
    +Segment : FixedString64Bytes
    +IsEmpty : bool
  }

  class FSMTransitionBlob <<struct>> {
    +Target : ushort
    +Mode : FSMConditionMode
    +Flags : FSMTransitionFlags
    +Priority : short
    +Order : ushort
    +ConditionStartIndex / Count : ushort
  }

  class FSMConditionGroupBlob <<struct>> {
    +Mode : FSMConditionMode
    +ConditionStartIndex / Count : ushort
  }

  class FSMCondition <<struct>> {
    +GroupIndex : ushort
    +PayloadIndex : ushort
    +Inverted : bool
  }

  class FSMStateSlotBlob <<struct>> {
    +Name : FixedString64Bytes
    +StateIndex : ushort
  }

  class FSMSlotMappingBlob <<struct>> {
    +Name : FixedString64Bytes
    +StateIndex : ushort
  }

  class PolyConditionInput <<existing struct>>

  FSMGraphBlob *-[#2563EB,thickness=2]-> FSMStateMachineBlob : StateMachine
  FSMSlotBlob *-[#2563EB,thickness=2]-> FSMStateMachineBlob : StateMachine
  FSMGraphBlob "1" *--> "1..*" FSMLayerBlob : Layers
  FSMGraphBlob "1" *--> "0..*" FSMStateSlotBlob : StateSlots
  FSMSlotBlob "1" *--> "0..*" FSMSlotMappingBlob : Mappings
  FSMStateMachineBlob "1" *-[#2563EB,thickness=2]-> "0..*" FSMStateBlob : States
  FSMStateMachineBlob "1" *-[#2563EB,thickness=2]-> "0..*" FSMStateBindingBlob : StateBindings[Index]
  FSMStateMachineBlob "1" *-[#2563EB,thickness=2]-> "0..*" FSMTransitionBlob : Transitions
  FSMTransitionBlob "1" *-[#2563EB,thickness=2]-> "0..*" FSMCondition : Condition range
  FSMCondition --> FSMConditionGroupBlob : GroupIndex
  FSMCondition --> PolyConditionInput : PayloadIndex
  FSMTransitionBlob --> FSMStateBlob : Target（所属状态机的局部索引）
  ConfigBlobDatabaseSingleton --> FSMGraphBlob : ContentHash
  ConfigBlobDatabaseSingleton --> FSMSlotBlob : ContentHash
}

HeroGraphSource --> Bake
WeaponGraphSource --> Bake
WeaponSlotSource --> Bake
Bake --> FSMGraphBlob
Bake --> FSMSlotBlob

legend bottom
  |= 关键约束 |= 说明 |
  | 最终 Graph | 角色默认 Graph 与武器 Override 结果都烘焙为完整 FSMGraphBlob |
  | 武器 Slot | 独立烘焙为 FSMSlotBlob，包含 Mapping 与状态树运行数组 |
  | 不支持嵌套 | FSMSlotBlob 没有 Layers / StateSlots，所有 StateSlotIndex 为空 |
  | 索引口径 | Blob 内一律是所属状态机的局部索引；组合索引只存在于 Runtime |
  | 运行时选择 | FRWeapon.FSMGraph 非空优先，否则 FRHero.FSMGraph |
  | 零改写 | Runtime 只读取 Blob 并建立 StateSlot 链接，不改写任何 Blob |
endlegend
@enduml
